DESCRIPTION:<html-blob>The Bloomington Commission on Sustainability\, in pa
 rtnership with the City of Bloomington’s Department of Economic and Sustain
 able Development\, would like to invite you to a special town hall event fo
 cused on a Just Transition for Bloomington. The hybrid event will take plac
 e on March 16th\, 2022 from 6-8PM at the Monroe County Public Library Audit
 orium and on Zoom.<br><br>Register to attend in person or virtually at:&nbs
 p\;<a href="https://bloomington.zoom.us/meeting/register/tZwocOihrzMvE9I14B
 NHO5CprXZ18m0h7Q5Y">https://bloomington.<u></u>zoom.us/meeting/register/<u>
 </u>tZwocOihrzMvE9I14BNHO5CprXZ18m<u></u>0h7Q5Y</a><br><br>For more informa
 tion please contact: Lauren Clemens\, Assistant Director of Sustainability 
 at lauren.clemens@bloomington.in.gov</html-blob>
LAST-MODIFIED:20230127T101856Z
LOCATION:Monroe County Public Library - Downtown\, 303 E Kirkwood Ave\, Blo
 omington\, IN 47408\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Bloomington Commission on Sustainability: Special Session
TRANSP:OPAQUE
