DESCRIPTION:<br><i><b>Per Executive Orders issued by the Governor\, Council
  meetings will be conducted electronically until&nbsp\;further notice. A Zo
 om link will be posted at least a week before this meeting.&nbsp\;</b></i><
 br><br>Meetings of the Common Council are generally held the first four Wed
 nesdays of the month at 6:30 pm\, in the Council Chambers (Suite 115\, City
  Hall\, 401 N. Morton).<br><br>For Council agendas\, legislation\, and all 
 background material\, please consult the Council's Legislative Packet poste
 d on the Council's webpage under "Council Meetings:"&nbsp\;<a href="http://
 bloomington.in.gov/council">http://bloomington.in.gov/council</a><br><br>Qu
 estions? Please contact the Council Office at 812.349.3409 or&nbsp\;<a href
 ="mailto:council@bloomington.in.gov">council@bloomington.in.gov</a>&nbsp\;&
 nbsp\;
