DESCRIPTION:<i><b>Per Executive Orders issued by the Governor\, Council mee
 tings will be conducted electronically until further notice. A Zoom link wi
 ll be posted at least a week before this meeting. </b></i><br><br>Council w
 ork Sessions provide an opportunity for members to preview city initiatives
 \, many of which are legislative items close to being formally introduced a
 t Council. <br><br>These meetings are typically held in the Library in Suit
 e 110 of City Hall at 12 noon. If the Library is too small for the meeting\
 , the Council may move it to another room in City Hall and post notice on t
 he door Suite 110 the day of the change in location.
