 l at the January 19\, 2022 Regular Session.</i></b><br><br>Council work Ses
 sions provide an opportunity for members to preview city initiatives\, many
  of which are legislative items close to being formally introduced at Counc
 il. <br><br>These meetings are typically held in the Library in Suite 110 o
 f City Hall at 12 noon. If the Library is too small for the meeting\, the C
 ouncil may move it to another room in City Hall and post notice on the door
  Suite 110 the day of the change in location.</html-blob>
