 401076</a><br>____________________________________<br>The Utilities Service
  Board oversees the Utilities Department and coordinates operations with Ci
 ty policies. Five appointees must be city residents\, and no more than two-
 thirds of the members may be of the same political party.<br><br>Statutory 
 Authority: 2.24.020<br><br>All meetings\, unless otherwise noted\, are held
  in the board room in the Utilities building at 600 E. Miller Drive (corner
  of Miller and Henderson). During the pandemic\, in-person meetings are sus
 pended. Please use above links to "join" the meeting virtually.&nbsp\;<br><
 br>Please use the following address and telephone for all Utilities Service
