DESCRIPTION:<p>Mayor Hamilton to Present Seventh State of the City Address:
  Forward Together</p><p>To join the event via Zoom\, visit the following li
 nk:&nbsp\;<a href="https://bloomington.zoom.us/j/82354732861?pwd=R3VxVnJwVk
 x6ZW0vUlRBWVZtOXNtUT09" id="ow729" __is_owner="true">https://bloomington.zo
 om.us/j/<wbr>82354732861?pwd=<wbr>R3VxVnJwVkx6ZW0vUlRBWVZtOXNtUT<wbr>09</a>
 </p><p>Passcode: 519878</p><p><b>WHAT: </b>Mayor John Hamilton presents his
  seventh annual State of the City address to the community at the Buskirk C
 humley Theater*. All are invited to attend the free event\, which will also
  include live musical entertainment\, poetry readings\, and a video present
 ation of community portraits. The event will be convened and adjourned by t
 he Bloomington Common Council\, for which it serves as an official meeting.
  Simultaneous interpretation in American Sign Language will be provided by 
 South Central Indiana Interpreting.&nbsp\;</p><p>*Due to COVID-19\, extra s
 afety precautions are being taken to limit the spread of the virus. In addi
 tion to the Buskirk-Chumley’s vaccine\, testing\, and mask requirements*\, 
 there will be limited seating to allow for physical distancing.</p><p><b>WH
 O:</b> In addition to Mayor Hamilton’s annual address\, the event will incl
 ude a call to order of the Bloomington City Council\, a performance by Fair
 view Elementary School\, a video presentation by Bloomington Portrait Group
 \, and several poetry readings by the Outspoken Poetry Club at Bloomington 
 High School South.&nbsp\;</p><p><b>WHEN</b>: Thursday\, February 24 at 7 p.
 m.\, doors open at 6:00 p.m.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</p><p><b>WHERE:</b>&nbsp\;Buskir
 k-Chumley Theater\, 114 East Kirkwood Avenue. This is a hybrid event with t
 he opportunity to attend over Zoom or via live streaming on the City of Blo
 omington Facebook page and YouTube Channel\, where the video presentation w
 ill be archived for future viewing. Community Access TV Services (CATS) wil
 l also broadcast the program. Registration is not required to attend this e
 vent.&nbsp\;</p><p><br></p>
