DESCRIPTION:Description:Meetings of the Common Council are generally held t
 he first four Wednesdays of the month at 6:30 pm\, in the Council Chambers 
 (Suite 115\, City Hall\, 401 N. Morton). For Council agendas\, legislation\
 , and all background material\, please consult the Council's Legislative Pa
 cket posted on the Council's webpage under "Council Meetings:" http://bloom
 ington.in.gov/council Questions? Please contact the Council Office at 812.3
 49.3409 or council@bloomington.in.gov *Auxiliary aids for people with disab
 ilities are available upon request with adequate notice. Please call 812.34
 9.3409 or e-mail council@bloomington.in.gov.
