DESCRIPTION:<p>This CAPS Commission meeting will be held either in person o
 r remotely\, depending on whether or not the Governor has declared a disast
 er emergency pursuant to the Governor's authority under Indiana Code Chapte
 r 10-14-3. There are two options\, described below:</p><p><b>Option 1:</b> 
 If the Governor declares or extends a disaster emergency through the date o
 f this hearing as stated above\, the meeting will be held remotely and only
  remotely as allowed by Indiana Code5-14-1.5-3.7 and a Zoom link will be po
 sted here at least a week before the meeting.</p><p><b>Option 2:</b> If the
  Governor does not declare or extend a disaster emergency through the date 
 of this hearing as stated above\, a hybrid meeting will be held in a room i
 n City Hall yet to be determined and also accessed via the Zoom link to be 
 posted here&nbsp\;at least a week before the meeting.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;<
 /p>
