 g will be conducted electronically until&nbsp\;further notice. A Zoom link 
 will be posted in the week before the scheduled meeting.</b></i><br><br>Mee
 tings of the Common Council are generally held the first four Wednesdays of
  the month at 6:30 pm\, in the Council Chambers (Suite 115\, City Hall\, 40
 1 N. Morton).&nbsp\;<br><br>For Council agendas\, legislation\, and all bac
 kground material\, please consult the Council's Legislative Packet posted o
 n the Council's webpage under "Council Meetings:"&nbsp\;<a href="http://blo
 omington.in.gov/council">http://bloomington.in.gov/council</a><br><br>Quest
 ions? Please contact the Council Office at 812.349.3409 or&nbsp\;<a href="m
 ailto:council@bloomington.in.gov">council@bloomington.in.gov</a>&nbsp\;&nbs
 p\;
