DESCRIPTION:Staff-Council Internal Work Sessions provide an opportunity for
  the Council members to learn about City initiatives\, most of which are cl
 ose to formal consideration by the Council. These meetings will be held in 
 the Council Office Library (Room 110 of City Hall) at noon. If the room is 
 too small for the meeting\, the Council may move it to another room in City
  Hall and post notice on the door of the Council Office the day of the chan
 ge in location.\n\n*Auxiliary aids for people with disabilities are availab
 le upon request with adequate notice. Please call (812) 349-3409 or e-mail 
 council@bloomington.in.gov. 
LAST-MODIFIED:20230804T203042Z
LOCATION:Council Library (Suite #11)
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Council-Staff Internal Work Session
TRANSP:OPAQUE
