 nited Central Dispatch (UCD) calls for the scheduling of a Joint Session of
  these bodies\, if needed\, to resolve issues related to the UCD budget for
  the following. The scheduling must be done at least 4 weeks in advance of 
 the meeting.  If budget matters are resolved before that time\, the meeting
  will not be necessary.
