DESCRIPTION:<i><b>Per Executive Orders issued by the Governor\, this meetin
 g will be conducted electronically until&nbsp\;further notice. A Zoom link 
 will be posted in the week before the scheduled meeting.</b></i><br><br>Mee
 tings of the Common Council are generally held the first four Wednesdays of
  the month at 6:30 pm\, in the Council Chambers (Suite 115\, City Hall\, 40
 1 N. Morton). <br><br>For Council agendas\, legislation\, and all backgroun
 d material\, please consult the Council's Legislative Packet posted on the 
 Council's webpage under "Council Meetings:" <a href="http://bloomington.in.
 gov/council">http://bloomington.in.gov/council</a><br><br>Questions?  Pleas
 e contact the Council Office at 812.349.3409 or <a href="mailto:council@blo
 omington.in.gov">council@bloomington.in.gov</a>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;
LAST-MODIFIED:20230804T202733Z
