DESCRIPTION:<i><b>Per Executive Orders issued by the Governor\, this meetin
 g will be conducted electronically until&nbsp\;further notice. A Zoom link 
 will be posted in the week before the scheduled meeting.</b></i>&nbsp\;<br>
 <br>Council work Sessions provide an opportunity for members to preview cit
 y initiatives\, many of which are legislative items close to being formally
  introduced at Council. <br><br>These meetings are typically held in the Li
 brary in Suite 110 of City Hall at 12 noon. If the Library is too small for
  the meeting\, the Council may move it to another room in City Hall and pos
 t notice on the door Suite 110 the day of the change in location.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230804T203309Z
LOCATION:Council Library
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Common Council Work Session
TRANSP:OPAQUE
