DESCRIPTION:<p>Please join the CAPS Commission on Saturday\, February 24th\
 , at 4 - 6 p.m. at the IU Cinema (1213 E. 7th St.)\, for a free\, ticketed 
 screening of Reimagining Safety\, an award-winning documentary by Matthew S
 olomon about the problems of policing and alternative solutions\, followed 
 by a 30-minute Q&amp\;A with the filmmaker and moderated by Indiana Univers
 ity professor and scholar of American Studies and History\, Micol Siegel.</
 p><p>Tickets can be reserved for free at the following link: <a href="https
 ://cinema.indiana.edu/upcoming-films/screening/spring-2024-saturday-februar
 y-24-400pm">https://cinema.indiana.edu/upcoming-films/screening/spring-2024
 -saturday-february-24-400pm</a></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20240117T200333Z
LOCATION:Indiana University Cinema\, 1213 E 7th St\, Bloomington\, IN 47405
 \, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Community Advisory on Public Safety ScreenShare Program with IU Cin
 ema Presenting: Reimagining Safety
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
