DESCRIPTION:Meetings of the Common Council are generally held the first fou
 r Wednesdays of the month at 7:30 pm\, in the Council Chambers (Suite 115\,
  City Hall\, 401 N. Morton). \n\nFor Council agendas\, legislation\, and al
 l background material\, please consult the Council's Legislative Packet pos
 ted on the Council's webpage under "Council Meetings:" http://bloomington.i
 n.gov/council.\n\nQuestions?  Please contact the Council Office at 812.349.
 3409 or council@bloomington.in.gov\n\n*Auxiliary aids for people with disab
 ilities are available upon request with adequate notice. Please call 812.34
 9.3409 or e-mail council@bloomington.in.gov. \n\n
