DESCRIPTION:<p>Please join the CAPS Commission on Sunday\, February 25th\, 
 from 2 - 4:30 p.m. in Room 125 of the IU School of Public Health <span>(102
 5 E. 7th St.\, Bloomington\, IN 47405) and over Zoom</span><span>\, for a p
 anel discussion f</span><span>eaturing in-person panelists: <i>Reimagining 
 Safety </i>filmmaker Matthew Solomon\, Nick Voyles of Bloomington's Indiana
  Recovery Alliance\, Jordan McIntre of Bloomington's New Leaf New Life\, Am
 ber Sherman a podcaster and Black liberationist of Memphis\, TN\, and Max F
 elker-Kantor of Ball State. Possible (unconfirmed) online panelists include
  national experts from the film. </span></p><p><b>Please reserve a free tic
 ket for the event at the following link: </b><a href="https://www.eventbrit
 e.com/e/reimagining-safety-in-bloomington-a-panel-discussion-on-community-s
 afety-tickets-790705380077">https://www.eventbrite.com/e/reimagining-safety
 -in-bloomington-a-panel-discussion-on-community-safety-tickets-790705380077
 </a>.</p><p><b><br>This event may also be accessed electronically via Zoom 
 (see information below).<br></b><span>Join Zoom Meeting<br></span><a href="
 https://bloomington.zoom.us/j/84034009823?pwd=JX4aKcMsnt0B4DtdykHhwFbZl9Otz
 Q.1">https://bloomington.zoom.us/j/84034009823?pwd=JX4aKcMsnt0B4DtdykHhwFbZ
 l9OtzQ.1</a><br><br><span>Meeting ID: 840 3400 9823<br></span><span>Passcod
 e: 409510<br><br></span><span>One tap mobile<br></span><span>+13052241968\,
 \,84034009823# US<br></span><span>+13092053325\,\,84034009823# US<br><br></
 span><span>Dial by your location<br></span><span>• +1 312 626 6799 US (Chic
 ago)<br></span><span>Meeting ID: 840 3400 9823<br><br></span><span>Find you
 r local number: </span><a href="https://bloomington.zoom.us/u/kcyIl603EL">h
 ttps://bloomington.zoom.us/u/kcyIl603EL</a></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20240117T200243Z
