 y initiatives\, many of which are legislative items close to being formally
  introduced at Council. <br><br>These meetings are typically held in the Li
 brary in Suite 110 of City Hall at 12 noon. If the Library is too small for
  the meeting\, the Council may move it to another room in City Hall and pos
 t notice on the door Suite 110 the day of the change in location.
