DESCRIPTION:<p><b>This meeting will be held in the Indiana University Schoo
 l of Public Health\, Room 125 (1025 E. 7th St.\, Bloomington\, IN 47405) an
 d may also be accessed electronically via Zoom (see information below).</b>
 </p><p>Join Zoom Meeting<br><a href="https://bloomington.zoom.us/j/84034009
 823?pwd=JX4aKcMsnt0B4DtdykHhwFbZl9OtzQ.1">https://bloomington.zoom.us/j/840
 34009823?pwd=JX4aKcMsnt0B4DtdykHhwFbZl9OtzQ.1</a><br><br>Meeting ID: 840 34
 00 9823<br>Passcode: 409510<br><br>One tap mobile<br>+13052241968\,\,840340
 09823# US<br>+13092053325\,\,84034009823# US<br><br>Dial by your location<b
 r>• +1 312 626 6799 US (Chicago)<br>Meeting ID: 840 3400 9823<br><br>Find y
 our local number: <a href="https://bloomington.zoom.us/u/kcyIl603EL">https:
 //bloomington.zoom.us/u/kcyIl603EL</a><br></p><p>--</p><p>For Discussion:</
 p><p><b>In this meeting\, we will practice the technical elements (room lig
 hting\, seating\, technology\, and all aspects of the online Zoom experienc
 e) of the panel discussion both in person at the School of Public Health\, 
 Room 125 and online via Zoom.</b><br><br>Event details as of 1/9/24:<br><br
 ><b>Saturday\, February 24 at 4 - 6PM at IU Cinema</b> - a free\, ticketed 
 screening of <i>Reimagining Safety</i>\, an award-winning documentary about
  the problems of policing and alternative solutions followed by 30-minute Q
 &amp\;A w film director moderated by IU's Micol Siegel.<br><br><br><b>Sunda
 y\, February 25 at 2 - 4:30PM at IU School of Public Health\, Rm 125 (also 
 on Zoom) </b>- a panel discussion entitled "Reimagining Safety in Bloomingt
 on" featuring in-person panelists film director Matthew Solomon\, Nick Voyl
 es of Bloomington's Indiana Recovery Alliance\, Jordan McIntre of Bloomingt
 on's New Leaf New Life\, Amber Sherman a podcaster and Black liberationist 
 of Memphis\, TN and Max Felker-Kantor of Ball State. Possible (unconfirmed)
  online panelists will include national experts from the film.<br></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20240117T205548Z
LOCATION:IU School of Public Health\, 1025 E 7th St\, Bloomington\, IN 4740
 5\, USA
