  (Suite 115\, City Hall\, 401 N. Morton).&nbsp\;<br><br>For Council agendas
 \, legislation\, and all background material\, please consult the Council's
  Legislative Packet posted on the Council's webpage under "Council Meetings
 :" <a href="http://bloomington.in.gov/council">http://bloomington.in.gov/co
 uncil</a> Questions?&nbsp\;<br><br>Please contact the Council Office at 812
 .349.3409 or <a href="mailto:council@bloomington.in.gov">council@bloomingto
 n.in.gov</a> *Auxiliary aids for people with disabilities are available upo
 n request with adequate notice. Please call 812.349.3409 or e-mail <a href=
 "mailto:council@bloomington.in.gov">council@bloomington.in.gov</a>.&nbsp\;&
 nbsp\;
