 formally introduced at Council. <br><br>These meetings are typically held i
 n the Library in Suite 110 of City Hall at 12 noon. If the Library is too s
 mall for the meeting\, the Council may move it to another room in City Hall
  and post notice on the door Suite 110 the day of the change in location.
