 g will be conducted electronically until&nbsp\;further notice.&nbsp\;</b></
 i><br><b><i><br></i></b><br>Council work Sessions provide an opportunity fo
 r members to preview city initiatives\, many of which are legislative items
  close to being formally introduced at Council. <br><br>These meetings are 
 typically held in the Library in Suite 110 of City Hall at 12 noon. If the 
 Library is too small for the meeting\, the Council may move it to another r
 oom in City Hall and post notice on the door Suite 110 the day of the chang
 e in location.
