DESCRIPTION:<i><b>Per Executive Orders issued by the Governor\, Council mee
 tings will be conducted electronically until&nbsp\;further notice. A Zoom l
 ink will be posted in the week before the scheduled meeting.</b></i>&nbsp\;
 <br><br>Council Work Sessions provide an opportunity for members to preview
  city initiatives\, many of which are legislative items close to being form
 ally introduced at Council. <br><br>These meetings are typically held in th
 e Library in Suite 110 of City Hall at 12 noon. If the Library is too small
  for the meeting\, the Council may move it to another room in City Hall and
  post notice on the door Suite 110 the day of the change in location.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230804T203655Z
LOCATION:Council Library
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Common Council Work Session
TRANSP:OPAQUE
