 te 115\, City Hall\, 401 N. Morton). <br><br>For Council agendas\, legislat
 ion\, and all background material\, please consult the Council's Legislativ
 e Packet posted on the Council's webpage under "Council Meetings:" <a href=
 "http://bloomington.in.gov/council">http://bloomington.in.gov/council</a><b
 r><br>Questions?  Please contact the Council Office at 812.349.3409 or <a h
