CREATED:20240110T164248Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><b>This meeting will be held in the McCloskey Conference Roo
 m (Suite 135\, City Hall\, 401 N. Morton St) and may also be accessed elect
 ronically via Zoom (see information below).</b></p><p>Join Zoom Meeting<br>
 <a href="https://bloomington.zoom.us/j/84034009823?pwd=JX4aKcMsnt0B4DtdykHh
 wFbZl9OtzQ.1">https://bloomington.zoom.us/j/84034009823?pwd=JX4aKcMsnt0B4Dt
 dykHhwFbZl9OtzQ.1</a><br><br>Meeting ID: 840 3400 9823<br>Passcode: 409510<
 br><br>One tap mobile<br>+13052241968\,\,84034009823# US<br>+13092053325\,\
 ,84034009823# US<br><br>Dial by your location<br>• +1 312 626 6799 US (Chic
 ago)<br>Meeting ID: 840 3400 9823<br><br>Find your local number: <a href="h
 ttps://bloomington.zoom.us/u/kcyIl603EL">https://bloomington.zoom.us/u/kcyI
 l603EL</a><br></p><p>--</p><p>For Discussion:</p><p><b>In this meeting\, we
  will finalize marketing materials and distribution plans. </b><br><br>Even
 t details as of 1/9/24:<br><br><b>Saturday\, February 24 at 4 - 6PM at IU C
 inema</b> - a free\, ticketed screening of <i>Reimagining Safety</i>\, an a
 ward-winning documentary about the problems of policing and alternative sol
 utions followed by 30-minute Q&amp\;A w film director moderated by IU's Mic
 ol Siegel.<br><br><br><b>Sunday\, February 25 at 2 - 4:30PM at IU School of
  Public Health\, Rm 125 (also on Zoom) </b>- a panel discussion entitled "R
 eimagining Safety in Bloomington" featuring in-person panelists film direct
 or Matthew Solomon\, Nick Voyles of Bloomington's Indiana Recovery Alliance
 \, Jordan McIntre of Bloomington's New Leaf New Life\, Amber Sherman a podc
 aster and Black liberationist of Memphis\, TN and Max Felker-Kantor of Ball
  State. Possible (unconfirmed) online panelists will include national exper
 ts from the film.<br></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20240117T205516Z
LOCATION:City Hall-1-Cityhall McCloskey Conference Room (RM #135) (39)
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Community Advisory on Public Safety Outreach Committee
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
