DESCRIPTION:<i><b>Per Executive Orders issued by the Governor\, Council mee
 tings will be conducted electronically until&nbsp\;further notice.&nbsp\;</
 b></i><br><b><i><br></i></b><br>Council Work Sessions provide an opportunit
 y for members to preview city initiatives\, many of which are legislative i
 tems close to being formally introduced at Council. <br><br>These meetings 
 are typically held in the Library in Suite 110 of City Hall at 12 noon. If 
 the Library is too small for the meeting\, the Council may move it to anoth
 er room in City Hall and post notice on the door Suite 110 the day of the c
 hange in location.
