 will hold her monthly Constituent&nbsp\;Meeting&nbsp\;on the last Saturday 
 of the month from 11:00 am to 12:00 pm in the McCloskey Room (135) of City 
 Hall. She welcomes all city residents\, especially those living in District
  5\, to attend. The&nbsp\;meeting&nbsp\;will feature a discussion of issues
  currently before the City Council and also leave time for issues to be bro
 ught forward by attendees.<br><br>Piedmont-Smith can be reached at&nbsp\;<a
  href="mailto:piedmoni@bloomington.in.gov">piedmoni@bloomington.in.gov</a>.
 &nbsp\;
