DESCRIPTION:<p>This CAPS Commission meeting will be held either in person o
 r remotely\, depending on whether or not the Governor has declared a disast
 er emergency pursuant to the Governor's authority under Indiana Code Chapte
 r 10-14-3. There are two options\, described below:</p><p><b>Option 1:</b>&
 nbsp\;If the Governor declares or extends a disaster emergency through the 
 date of this hearing as stated above\, the meeting will be held remotely an
 d only remotely as allowed by Indiana Code5-14-1.5-3.7 and a Zoom link will
  be posted here at least a week before the meeting.</p><p><b>Option 2:</b>&
 nbsp\;If the Governor does not declare or extend a disaster emergency throu
 gh the date of this hearing as stated above\, a hybrid meeting will be held
  in a room in City Hall yet to be determined and also accessed via the Zoom
  link to be posted here&nbsp\;at least a week before the meeting.&nbsp\; &n
 bsp\;</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20250324T101741Z
LOCATION:TBD
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Community Advisory on Public Safety - Work Session
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
