CREATED:20250827T200154Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>TIM training is designed to improve responder safety\, enhan
 ce communication\, and reduce roadway clearance times during incidents. By 
 working together\, agencies can prevent secondary crashes\, protect lives\,
  and keep traffic moving efficiently. For more information\, see the flier 
 attached to this calendar event.  </p><p>This training is provided at no co
 st. The target audience for this course includes all TIM disciplines:</p><u
 l><li>Communications<u></u><u></u></li><li>Emergency Management<u></u><u></
 u></li><li>Emergency Medical Services (EMS)<u></u><u></u></li><li>Fire/Resc
 ue<u></u><u></u></li><li>Law Enforcement<u></u><u></u></li><li>Towing and R
 ecovery<u></u><u></u></li><li>Transportation/Public Works<u></u><u></u></li
 ></ul><p><u></u>A multi-discipline class is ideal\, as it helps bring all r
 esponders together for better coordination.</p><p>Please register <a href="
 https://indiana.acadisonline.com/AcadisViewer/Registration/PublicEventDetai
 ls.aspx?ReturnURL=_______5zV4_0PeZQRPthvDO8Jxuw--(zavdo1tNWVgWrDGsyYEb8HZoX
 Er2xeM4GWlbKPXtNOG_MK7tzscaZKQjQBEfEW7f2dPt18r2X.jFB8CpppPco48wa688TNMqaV4Y
