 sfzCCyd8oPfIeEkAW1AUJAhzmnuHiZA4XKMg1ytsZjGTrqJKH5lB6pwXTLef4QXpnhwOpXurDYe
 cYhH4LhsJUzVTMxdBCiJ.YwSgYTA--&id=51315&reg=Y" target="_blank">on the India
 na Public Safety Personnel Portal (Acadis)\, CLASS #TIM0007</a>. If you do 
 not have an Acadis account\, the following link provides information on how
  to obtain a PSID number from IDHS (can take up to 7 days): <a href="https:
 //www.in.gov/dhs/fire-and-building-safety/public-safety-identification-psid
 -application/" target="_blank">https://www.in.gov/dhs/fire-<u></u>and-build
 ing-safety/public-<u></u>safety-identification-psid-<u></u>application/</a>
  </p><p>Contact indianatime@indot.gov &amp\; katie.gandhi@bloomington.in.go
 v with questions about this event.</p>
